section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:38:02.264Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:mingshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:mingshi-6ff51c029f915f39","query":"鐵鉉","count":3,"offset":2478,"excerpt":"\n\n　　五月辛未，奔濟南。燕兵陷德州，遂攻濟南。庚辰，景隆敗績於城下，南走。參政鐵鉉、都督盛庸悉力禦之。\n\n　　六月己酉，遣尚寶丞李得成諭燕罷兵。\n\n　　秋八月癸巳，承天門災，詔求直言。戊申，盛庸、鐵鉉擊敗燕兵，濟南圍解，復德州。\n\n　　九月，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-0882414d996367cb","query":"鐵鉉","count":3,"offset":1828,"excerpt":"鉞，走德州。\n\n　　五月癸酉，王入德州，景隆走濟南。庚辰，攻濟南，敗景隆軍城下。鐵鉉、盛庸堅守，不克。\n\n　　秋八月戊申，解圍還北平。\n\n　　九月，盛庸代李景隆將，復取德州，與吳傑、平安、徐凱相掎角，以困北平。時徐凱方城滄州，王佯出兵攻遼東，至","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-391bd66df4a68271","query":"鐵鉉","count":1,"offset":2336,"excerpt":"河北。　景清二月任左。\n\n練子寧二月任右。\n\n二年庚辰　紞　新\n\n鈍　迪　瑺\n\n鐵鉉十二月任督軍。　泰\n\n昭　賜\n\n震直　清\n\n子寧\n\n　吏部尚書　戶部尚書　禮部尚書　兵部尚書　刑部尚書　工部尚書　左、右都御史\n\n三年辛巳　紞　新\n\n鈍　迪二月","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-bfd79d8b71911cc8","query":"鐵鉉","count":5,"offset":24,"excerpt":"〔篇題：卷一百四十二 列傳第三十〕\n〔編者說明：鐵鉉 暴昭〔（侯泰）〕陳性善〔（陳植 王彬 崇剛）〕張昺〔（謝貴 彭二 葛誠 余逢辰）〕宋忠〔（余瑱）〕馬宣〔（曾浚 卜萬 朱鑒 石撰）〕瞿能〔（莊得 楚智 皂旗張","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-d28d5f9be1bce176","query":"鐵鉉","count":2,"offset":5684,"excerpt":"巍亦可以無愧矣。\n\n書數上，皆不報。\n\n已而景隆兵敗，巍自拔南歸。至臨邑，遇參政鐵鉉，相持痛哭。奔濟南，誓死拒守，屢敗燕兵。及京城破，巍自經死驛舍。郁疏略曰：\n\n諸王親則太祖遺體，貴則孝康皇帝手足，尊則陛下叔父。使二帝在天之靈，子孫為天子，而弟","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-ec8ddeb3a2f04ba6","query":"鐵鉉","count":3,"offset":123,"excerpt":"，遂隸景隆麾下。二年四月，景隆敗於白溝河，走濟南。燕師隨至，景隆復南走。庸與參政鐵鉉悉力固守，燕師攻圍三月不克。庸、鉉乘夜出兵掩擊，燕眾大敗，解圍去。乘勝復德州。九月，論功封歷城侯，祿千石。尋命為平燕將軍，充總兵官。陳暉、平安為左右副總兵，馬溥","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-3233894f7cd2e90d","query":"鐵鉉","count":1,"offset":3361,"excerpt":"以奇兵繞其後，襲破之，降萬餘人。從攻滄州，破東門入，斬首萬餘級。東昌之戰，盛庸、鐵鉉圍成祖數重。張玉戰死。事急，能帥周長等殊死鬥，翼成祖潰圍出。復從戰夾河，譚淵死，燕師挫。能至，再戰再捷，軍復振。與平安戰槁城，敗之。追奔至真定，略地彰德、定州，","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":7,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:mingshi-6ff51c029f915f39","bookId":"book:mingshi","requestedTitle":"明史/卷4","title":"明史/卷4","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B74","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2594634","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%98%8E%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B74?action=history","revisionId":2594634,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-08-30T13:20:43Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:58:10.667Z","sha256":"2dee7ca3ee519c6dabc48dca2414011ada1f5d202c464349adb3416d0d7407ef","textSha256":"1834bbf34d8a77b3279636a7437bce88687e65cb6c2346a97c1f4a98c52aca4e","expandedWikitextSha256":"2dee7ca3ee519c6dabc48dca2414011ada1f5d202c464349adb3416d0d7407ef","characters":4507,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/mingshi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:44.927Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/34446af0c9e206b2ab34.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/34446af0c9e206b2ab34.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:mingshi-0882414d996367cb","bookId":"book:m